.md: Worker loop](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/blob/main/docs/proposal.md#worker-loop)\n**Depends on:** #35\n\n","numLines":27,"startLine":1,"totalLines":27}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SddbWZjQ7AaJxav5rSRucp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
